{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:17 2026-08-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:17 2026-08-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:17 2026-08-28 HKT</p><p>今日（28日）早上7時54分，黃大仙雙鳳街14號地下一麵包舖，其面積約4米乘3米的天花，連同部分石屎墮下，石屎碎擊中一名年約20多歲女顧客。她擦傷頭及手腳，仍然清醒，救護員接報在場，稍後將她送院治理。</p><img alt=\"女傷者頭部包紮後送院敷治。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/639b66fce9eb1f4eefe1aeface33974b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_05_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女傷者清醒送院敷治。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c9c5fec3962428246890212664e87fc7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_05_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"舖內天花連同石屎墮下。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9263f73395a8eede7f3e26c606b3969a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_32_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"麵包舖對開行人路被圍封。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/866edc25675eb53ac1ecf973941e4ead/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/25cbd305f272fa3efd23cb9549c604ae/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_37.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"石屎墮下傷女顧客。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/71b6a532d7ab233f8db14df33c6e0528/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場滿地石屎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2f928f84fa5c420d58e4bc68f2b6588e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_35.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/01ed5cd0ea7f88ae6655be745b2a5f39/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_34_2_.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，天花連同石屎墮地，部分天花半天吊，地面滿佈一塊塊石屎，舖內一片凌亂，有麵包及月餅包裝亦滿佈石屎碎。警員圍封店舖，屋宇署人員亦到場檢查結構是否穩定。</p><img alt=\"墮下石屎頗大塊。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/59eff36e699643b2ac333d6c4ce5329f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員圍封麵包舖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bf5e6883f7d6091056bedb56476bc175/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ab887a23f244f64a7dd16c0ae380acd7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_32.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9a2806132b2dc6453ac6c0c1b2d6c00/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"舖頭外亦滿佈石屎。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2263bb308f0d7111331b56088e622a73/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_09_28_30.jpeg\"/><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T02:00:00.671126+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}